			"label": "Forge",
			"icon": "layers",
			"order": 95,
			"description": "A coding space assembled ENTIRELY from marketplace parts: this plugin's layout, rail-t3 in the rail, session-board in the dock, mochi-mark as the badge, thread-minimal and composer-minimal as the session surface's two sections, and env-minimal pinned top-right. The one piece that is NOT from the marketplace is the workspace host filling forge-main, because no contributed workspace component exists yet — that is the honest gap this space exists to expose.",
